{
  "language": "en",
  "language_probability": 0.9718455076217651,
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_index": 0,
      "start_seconds": 9.74,
      "end_seconds": 26.74,
      "text": "Well, the song that this YouTube clip is from is a song called Elegant Decovince, which is a book that I read about New Orleans, which is kind of explaining the whole decay of New Orleans, but yet the elegance that it had at one time, well, it still has, even with the decay and the patinas.",
      "confidence": -0.2471527014123766
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 1,
      "start_seconds": 26.74,
      "end_seconds": 35.74,
      "text": "But the groove was kind of based on a New Orleans groove, which was in the key of D, and I think it was like a...more like D blues, pretty much.",
      "confidence": -0.2471527014123766
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 2,
      "start_seconds": 43.58,
      "end_seconds": 48.58,
      "text": "That's kind of the lick with some open strings ringing that if you have...let me clean it up a little bit.",
      "confidence": -0.19491612158640467
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 3,
      "start_seconds": 48.58,
      "end_seconds": 64.23,
      "text": "Here, you can kind of flail away with the right hand, which is probably a flashback to some early Led Zeppelin Jimmy Page stuff.",
      "confidence": -0.19491612158640467
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 4,
      "start_seconds": 64.23,
      "end_seconds": 72.23,
      "text": "And I like...it goes through changes with the other melodies in the other sections, but most of the solo section is all in pretty much just D blues, I think.",
      "confidence": -0.19491612158640467
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 5,
      "start_seconds": 72.23,
      "end_seconds": 82.23,
      "text": "And the way we're using...I mean, you know, a lot of my songs are the same way where I kind of use the songs as vehicles just to get the band into these kind of creative zones of improvising.",
      "confidence": -0.10095687326172302
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 6,
      "start_seconds": 82.23,
      "end_seconds": 90.23,
      "text": "You know, it's not really about notey playing over a lot of cerebral chord changes. It's more about seeing what you can make up with one chord and make it interesting.",
      "confidence": -0.10095687326172302
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 7,
      "start_seconds": 90.23,
      "end_seconds": 96.23,
      "text": "So we're always trying to, you know, channel our Jeff Beck within us to try to get something really creative happening.",
      "confidence": -0.10095687326172302
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 8,
      "start_seconds": 96.23,
      "end_seconds": 104.23,
      "text": "That's basically what the groove is about. It's just kind of a New Orleans-esque type of groove over D blues, pretty much.",
      "confidence": -0.12719280463604887
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 9,
      "start_seconds": 104.23,
      "end_seconds": 118.99,
      "text": "Yeah, probably at the very beginning of that...I mean, usually I like to set up solos with, like, as simple as possible.",
      "confidence": -0.12719280463604887
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 10,
      "start_seconds": 118.99,
      "end_seconds": 126.99,
      "text": "But sometimes I just take it out because the band...usually the keyboard player is laying out, so your harmonic boundaries are wide open, you know?",
      "confidence": -0.12719280463604887
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 11,
      "start_seconds": 126.99,
      "end_seconds": 132.99,
      "text": "So probably what I was thinking in that early phrase when you hear the major 7, I would guess...",
      "confidence": -0.12719280463604887
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 12,
      "start_seconds": 132.99,
      "end_seconds": 135.99,
      "text": "I'm just guessing now because who knows what I was actually thinking that night.",
      "confidence": -0.1803628360040677
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 13,
      "start_seconds": 135.99,
      "end_seconds": 142.99,
      "text": "But I probably was thinking the 5 chord. I do that sometimes. I'll just superimpose a 5 chord where there's not one being played.",
      "confidence": -0.1803628360040677
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 14,
      "start_seconds": 142.99,
      "end_seconds": 147.99,
      "text": "So it sounds like I'm playing a major 7 of the chord, but really what I'm doing is kind of outlining the 5 chord,",
      "confidence": -0.1803628360040677
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 15,
      "start_seconds": 147.99,
      "end_seconds": 152.99,
      "text": "which, of course, is just going to lead you back to the 1 chord. So if it's, like, an E in D minor...",
      "confidence": -0.1803628360040677
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 16,
      "start_seconds": 152.99,
      "end_seconds": 165.18,
      "text": "So all I did was play some A-alpha stuff.",
      "confidence": -0.1803628360040677
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 17,
      "start_seconds": 165.18,
      "end_seconds": 168.18,
      "text": "Now, learning the modes is like, you know, I don't want you too much into theory or anything,",
      "confidence": -0.1803628360040677
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 18,
      "start_seconds": 168.18,
      "end_seconds": 174.18,
      "text": "but the one mode in melodic minor that's really super useful is the 7th mode from melodic minor, which is the altered scale.",
      "confidence": -0.10601731690954655
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 19,
      "start_seconds": 174.18,
      "end_seconds": 183.18,
      "text": "Because thinking 5-1-5-1 happens in everything from Beatles to weather report to playing traditional jazz.",
      "confidence": -0.10601731690954655
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 20,
      "start_seconds": 183.18,
      "end_seconds": 187.18,
      "text": "So I do that a lot. I mean, there's a lot of ways to go...a lot of guys go up the half-step, down the half-step.",
      "confidence": -0.10601731690954655
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 21,
      "start_seconds": 187.18,
      "end_seconds": 192.18,
      "text": "Sometimes they go to, like, the 4 minor and play melodic minor from the 4 chord that I'm at.",
      "confidence": -0.10601731690954655
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 22,
      "start_seconds": 192.18,
      "end_seconds": 197.18,
      "text": "That's kind of interesting. A lot of times it's just geometric shapes that I find",
      "confidence": -0.10601731690954655
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 23,
      "start_seconds": 197.18,
      "end_seconds": 201.18,
      "text": "and I just kind of repeat them as motifs and make them connect to the scale I know.",
      "confidence": -0.11794876332251017
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 24,
      "start_seconds": 201.18,
      "end_seconds": 205.18,
      "text": "It's a lot of multitasking going on, because a lot of times I'm kind of thinking something else,",
      "confidence": -0.11794876332251017
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 25,
      "start_seconds": 205.18,
      "end_seconds": 211.18,
      "text": "but I'm still kind of seeing the D blues scale, so I always can get hop back on track, depending on the moment.",
      "confidence": -0.11794876332251017
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 26,
      "start_seconds": 215.26,
      "end_seconds": 232.15,
      "text": "But you'll find a lot of times that, like, on the downbeat I'll usually resolve back.",
      "confidence": -0.11794876332251017
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 27,
      "start_seconds": 232.15,
      "end_seconds": 234.15,
      "text": "People ask me all the time when I'm thinking about it when I play outside,",
      "confidence": -0.11794876332251017
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 28,
      "start_seconds": 234.15,
      "end_seconds": 240.15,
      "text": "and a lot of times I think what I'm probably doing in my head is I'm kind of targeting the notes I really want",
      "confidence": -0.11794876332251017
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 29,
      "start_seconds": 240.15,
      "end_seconds": 245.15,
      "text": "on the strong beats of the measure, so I'm targeting it on the downbeat of the measure,",
      "confidence": -0.20166645472562766
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 30,
      "start_seconds": 245.15,
      "end_seconds": 248.15,
      "text": "maybe beats 2 or 4 wherever I feel, but I'm always kind of going,",
      "confidence": -0.20166645472562766
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 31,
      "start_seconds": 248.15,
      "end_seconds": 251.15,
      "text": "I can't just go randomly off into another key or it's just going to sound horrible, you know?",
      "confidence": -0.20166645472562766
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 32,
      "start_seconds": 251.15,
      "end_seconds": 255.15,
      "text": "But a lot of times when I transcribe, when I hear anything interesting,",
      "confidence": -0.20166645472562766
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 33,
      "start_seconds": 255.15,
      "end_seconds": 258.15,
      "text": "I'll transcribe it, whether it's an Alan Holder's lick or a Michael Brecker lick,",
      "confidence": -0.20166645472562766
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 34,
      "start_seconds": 258.15,
      "end_seconds": 260.15,
      "text": "you know, like I...",
      "confidence": -0.20166645472562766
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 35,
      "start_seconds": 260.15,
      "end_seconds": 267.13,
      "text": "Now that is just a...I stole...it's just like one little beat in my teeth,",
      "confidence": -0.20166645472562766
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 36,
      "start_seconds": 267.13,
      "end_seconds": 269.13,
      "text": "and why not even...I'm sure it wasn't even a whole thing,",
      "confidence": -0.20166645472562766
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 37,
      "start_seconds": 269.13,
      "end_seconds": 271.13,
      "text": "but I probably...all I heard in my head was...",
      "confidence": -0.20128835522153843
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 38,
      "start_seconds": 273.13,
      "end_seconds": 275.13,
      "text": "and then I just kind of put it wherever it fits,",
      "confidence": -0.20128835522153843
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 39,
      "start_seconds": 275.13,
      "end_seconds": 278.13,
      "text": "symmetrically on the fretboard, within the scales,",
      "confidence": -0.20128835522153843
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 40,
      "start_seconds": 278.13,
      "end_seconds": 280.13,
      "text": "and, you know, sometimes you luck up, but you can...",
      "confidence": -0.20128835522153843
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 41,
      "start_seconds": 282.13,
      "end_seconds": 285.54,
      "text": "and I always bring it back to blues,",
      "confidence": -0.20128835522153843
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 42,
      "start_seconds": 285.54,
      "end_seconds": 289.54,
      "text": "because, you know, blues, you know, blues everybody can relate to.",
      "confidence": -0.20128835522153843
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 43,
      "start_seconds": 289.54,
      "end_seconds": 291.54,
      "text": "I mean, my mother, if I just plucked a...",
      "confidence": -0.20128835522153843
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 44,
      "start_seconds": 292.54,
      "end_seconds": 294.54,
      "text": "and played a bunch of house stuff, you know, my mother would be going,",
      "confidence": -0.20128835522153843
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 45,
      "start_seconds": 294.54,
      "end_seconds": 295.54,
      "text": "what is wrong with my son, you know?",
      "confidence": -0.20128835522153843
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 46,
      "start_seconds": 295.54,
      "end_seconds": 297.54,
      "text": "Where do we go wrong?",
      "confidence": -0.20128835522153843
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 47,
      "start_seconds": 297.54,
      "end_seconds": 299.54,
      "text": "But if I'm...if I resolve it to a blues lick,",
      "confidence": -0.20128835522153843
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 48,
      "start_seconds": 299.54,
      "end_seconds": 301.54,
      "text": "you know, she's going to stand up and yell with the rest of the people, you know?",
      "confidence": -0.1259505090775428
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 49,
      "start_seconds": 301.54,
      "end_seconds": 305.54,
      "text": "So I...a lot of times when I practice these outlicks,",
      "confidence": -0.1259505090775428
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 50,
      "start_seconds": 305.54,
      "end_seconds": 309.54,
      "text": "I don't only learn the motif, which I see it as motif or geometric shape,",
      "confidence": -0.1259505090775428
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 51,
      "start_seconds": 309.54,
      "end_seconds": 313.54,
      "text": "I really practice getting back to a bluesy lick that everybody can relate to,",
      "confidence": -0.1259505090775428
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 52,
      "start_seconds": 313.54,
      "end_seconds": 314.54,
      "text": "that I can relate to, you know?",
      "confidence": -0.1259505090775428
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 53,
      "start_seconds": 314.54,
      "end_seconds": 315.54,
      "text": "That's the big...that's the big thing.",
      "confidence": -0.1259505090775428
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 54,
      "start_seconds": 315.54,
      "end_seconds": 317.54,
      "text": "So if I learn a lick like...",
      "confidence": -0.1259505090775428
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 55,
      "start_seconds": 318.54,
      "end_seconds": 322.62,
      "text": "I'll bring it back home with something like that, you know?",
      "confidence": -0.1259505090775428
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 56,
      "start_seconds": 324.62,
      "end_seconds": 338.74,
      "text": "I don't mean to drop any names or anything,",
      "confidence": -0.1259505090775428
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 57,
      "start_seconds": 338.74,
      "end_seconds": 341.74,
      "text": "but when I was at school at MI,",
      "confidence": -0.1259505090775428
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 58,
      "start_seconds": 341.74,
      "end_seconds": 346.74,
      "text": "one of my...we weren't really friends or mortals or acquaintances,",
      "confidence": -0.14439089983314662
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 59,
      "start_seconds": 346.74,
      "end_seconds": 348.74,
      "text": "was Jeff Buckley, who was a great Jeff Buckley,",
      "confidence": -0.14439089983314662
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 60,
      "start_seconds": 348.74,
      "end_seconds": 351.74,
      "text": "who was not many people know, but he was really a great jazz player.",
      "confidence": -0.14439089983314662
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 61,
      "start_seconds": 351.74,
      "end_seconds": 354.74,
      "text": "I mean, he, like all of us at MI, were working over chord changes a lot.",
      "confidence": -0.14439089983314662
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 62,
      "start_seconds": 354.74,
      "end_seconds": 356.74,
      "text": "And one thing I noticed about him, even back then,",
      "confidence": -0.14439089983314662
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 63,
      "start_seconds": 356.74,
      "end_seconds": 359.74,
      "text": "and before he went on his...what he really made him famous,",
      "confidence": -0.14439089983314662
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 64,
      "start_seconds": 359.74,
      "end_seconds": 361.74,
      "text": "you know, his songwriting stuff ability,",
      "confidence": -0.14439089983314662
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 65,
      "start_seconds": 361.74,
      "end_seconds": 365.74,
      "text": "was that he had...his personality was such that he would...",
      "confidence": -0.14439089983314662
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 66,
      "start_seconds": 365.74,
      "end_seconds": 370.74,
      "text": "if he wanted to make a point, instead of blasting it out of you as loud as he could,",
      "confidence": -0.14439089983314662
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 67,
      "start_seconds": 370.74,
      "end_seconds": 375.74,
      "text": "he would talk very softly and very deliberately and very...very precisely,",
      "confidence": -0.1557520239902057
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 68,
      "start_seconds": 375.74,
      "end_seconds": 376.74,
      "text": "very...what's the word I'm looking for?",
      "confidence": -0.1557520239902057
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 69,
      "start_seconds": 376.74,
      "end_seconds": 378.74,
      "text": "Very deliberately for everything, you know, he said.",
      "confidence": -0.1557520239902057
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 70,
      "start_seconds": 378.74,
      "end_seconds": 381.74,
      "text": "And I found a lot of times it's the same way with guitar.",
      "confidence": -0.1557520239902057
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 71,
      "start_seconds": 381.74,
      "end_seconds": 387.74,
      "text": "I mean, I often like to start my solos at least with less instead of more.",
      "confidence": -0.1557520239902057
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 72,
      "start_seconds": 387.74,
      "end_seconds": 390.74,
      "text": "And I do that in a lot of...a few different ways.",
      "confidence": -0.1557520239902057
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 73,
      "start_seconds": 390.74,
      "end_seconds": 393.74,
      "text": "I mean, dynamically, I do a lot of legato picking.",
      "confidence": -0.1557520239902057
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 74,
      "start_seconds": 393.74,
      "end_seconds": 396.74,
      "text": "So my right hand changes a lot,",
      "confidence": -0.1557520239902057
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 75,
      "start_seconds": 396.74,
      "end_seconds": 399.74,
      "text": "from picking heavy for bluesy, robin 40 type stuff,",
      "confidence": -0.1557520239902057
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 76,
      "start_seconds": 399.74,
      "end_seconds": 403.74,
      "text": "to where I tuck it away, and I actually just kind of rush with my right hand like this,",
      "confidence": -0.19957624851389133
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 77,
      "start_seconds": 403.74,
      "end_seconds": 407.74,
      "text": "as opposed to if I were picking everything that sounded like that,",
      "confidence": -0.19957624851389133
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 78,
      "start_seconds": 407.74,
      "end_seconds": 410.74,
      "text": "and I had my action so low it probably buzzed like crazy.",
      "confidence": -0.19957624851389133
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 79,
      "start_seconds": 410.74,
      "end_seconds": 416.74,
      "text": "But when you brush, you can get anywhere from really like soft like that,",
      "confidence": -0.19957624851389133
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 80,
      "start_seconds": 416.74,
      "end_seconds": 419.74,
      "text": "almost like hardly any volume at all,",
      "confidence": -0.19957624851389133
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 81,
      "start_seconds": 419.74,
      "end_seconds": 421.74,
      "text": "just snapping it.",
      "confidence": -0.19957624851389133
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 82,
      "start_seconds": 421.74,
      "end_seconds": 422.74,
      "text": "I do that a lot.",
      "confidence": -0.19957624851389133
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 83,
      "start_seconds": 422.74,
      "end_seconds": 424.74,
      "text": "And that's years of, you know, listening to...",
      "confidence": -0.19957624851389133
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 84,
      "start_seconds": 424.74,
      "end_seconds": 426.74,
      "text": "I grew up listening to Dwayne Almond,",
      "confidence": -0.19957624851389133
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 85,
      "start_seconds": 426.74,
      "end_seconds": 428.74,
      "text": "and he played a lot of slide guitar and used his fingers mostly.",
      "confidence": -0.19957624851389133
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 86,
      "start_seconds": 428.74,
      "end_seconds": 429.74,
      "text": "And that's what I got.",
      "confidence": -0.1401896423898464
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 87,
      "start_seconds": 429.74,
      "end_seconds": 431.74,
      "text": "And you can harmonically, so many things jump out",
      "confidence": -0.1401896423898464
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 88,
      "start_seconds": 431.74,
      "end_seconds": 433.74,
      "text": "when you use the flesh on the fingers, you know,",
      "confidence": -0.1401896423898464
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 89,
      "start_seconds": 433.74,
      "end_seconds": 436.74,
      "text": "in different places on the...over the top of the pickups.",
      "confidence": -0.1401896423898464
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 90,
      "start_seconds": 436.74,
      "end_seconds": 438.74,
      "text": "So that just became really natural to me.",
      "confidence": -0.1401896423898464
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 91,
      "start_seconds": 438.74,
      "end_seconds": 441.74,
      "text": "And, you know, also, say if the string of the guitar",
      "confidence": -0.1401896423898464
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 92,
      "start_seconds": 441.74,
      "end_seconds": 443.74,
      "text": "were strung between me and you, this is long...",
      "confidence": -0.1401896423898464
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 93,
      "start_seconds": 443.74,
      "end_seconds": 446.74,
      "text": "I kind of stroke, you know, like this.",
      "confidence": -0.1401896423898464
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 94,
      "start_seconds": 446.74,
      "end_seconds": 447.74,
      "text": "This is really the way.",
      "confidence": -0.1401896423898464
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 95,
      "start_seconds": 447.74,
      "end_seconds": 449.74,
      "text": "So I never really pick like most conventional guys do.",
      "confidence": -0.1401896423898464
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 96,
      "start_seconds": 449.74,
      "end_seconds": 451.74,
      "text": "I kind of stroke it on the side.",
      "confidence": -0.1401896423898464
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 97,
      "start_seconds": 451.74,
      "end_seconds": 452.74,
      "text": "And I use three fingers for a pick.",
